      "content": "it's just been happening maybe twice a week. i dont really wanna go to the doctor if i dont have to, it's so expensive and pretty much always ends up being something minor anyway. do u think there's anything i can just do at home to clear the fog? maybe some vitamins or a specific supplement to help my brain function better while i deal with this stress?",
